{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Vandermonde","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Matrix.Block","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.GeomSum","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Fin"],"declarations":15,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant.alt_add_stair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant.alt_add_stair","kind":"theorem","line":199,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/Bialternant.lean#L199-L232","doc":"**The bialternant formula** `a_{ν+δ}(x) = a_δ(x) · s_ν(x)`, for every weakly increasing `ν`\nand every family of elements of a commutative ring. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant.schur_index_monotone","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant.schur_index_monotone","kind":"theorem","line":186,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/Bialternant.lean#L186-L197","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant.alt_stair_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant.alt_stair_succ","kind":"theorem","line":168,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/Bialternant.lean#L168-L184","doc":"Branching for the Vandermonde alternant: every gap is `1`, so the sum has one term. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant.alt_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant.alt_zero","kind":"theorem","line":165,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/Bialternant.lean#L165-L166","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant.stair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant.stair","kind":"def","line":162,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/Bialternant.lean#L162-L163","doc":"The staircase `δ_j = j`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant.schur","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant.schur","kind":"def","line":152,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/Bialternant.lean#L152-L160","doc":"The Schur polynomial `s_ν(x₀, …, x_{N−1})` of a weakly *increasing* sequence `ν`\n(a partition written smallest part first), defined by branching on `x₀`: the interlacing\n`μ_j = ν_j + k_j ∈ [ν_j, ν_{j+1}]` carries weight `x₀^{|ν| − |μ|}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant.alt_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant.alt_succ","kind":"theorem","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/Bialternant.lean#L112-L148","doc":"**The alternant branching rule.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant.det_sum_rows","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant.det_sum_rows","kind":"theorem","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/Bialternant.lean#L103-L110","doc":"Determinant of a matrix whose row `j` is a sum indexed by `Fin (d j)`: multilinearity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant.pow_add_sub_pow_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant.pow_add_sub_pow_mul","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/Bialternant.lean#L91-L101","doc":"`u^{a+d} − y^d u^a = (u − y) · Σ_{k<d} u^{a+k} y^{d−1−k}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant.det_opMat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant.det_opMat","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/Bialternant.lean#L78-L89","doc":"Row `0` of the operated matrix is `(x₀^{α₀}, 0, …, 0)`, so the determinant is that entry\ntimes the minor on rows and columns `1, …, N`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant.mul_colOp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant.mul_colOp","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/Bialternant.lean#L56-L76","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant.opMat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant.opMat","kind":"def","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/Bialternant.lean#L50-L54","doc":"The matrix after the column operations. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant.det_colOp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant.det_colOp","kind":"theorem","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/Bialternant.lean#L41-L48","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant.colOp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant.colOp","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/Bialternant.lean#L37-L39","doc":"The column-operation matrix: `1` on the diagonal and `−x₀^{α_j − α_{j−1}}` just above it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant.alt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Bialternant.alt","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/Bialternant.lean#L33-L35","doc":"The alternant `det (x_i ^ α_j)`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}